*.jpg

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db


# The `skills` CLI also emits a "universal" copy of every skill under agent/ for other agent
# tools (Amp, Cline, Codex-universal, …). This repo drives Claude Code from .claude/skills and
# Codex from the .agents/skills symlinks, so that copy is an unused duplicate of every SKILL.md.
agent/

